node_modules/
dist/
.env
.env.*
# Templates, not secrets. README.md, docs/DEPLOYMENT.md and docker-compose.yml
# all tell you to copy .env.docker.example as the first step of a deployment,
# and `.env.*` meant it was never committed -- so that step could not be
# followed from a fresh clone. Every value in it is a placeholder.
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example
*.log
coverage/
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
